{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cosy desktop idle game you can place anywhere on your screen! Oversee a tiny robot that keeps your room spotless while you work, focus, or unwind. Unlock various upgrades and hats for each iteration of your tidy robot. Transform your space as you unlock countless decorations to uniquely personalise your room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/28ee269ee2cb3dc50dfbba4b86f140c7.poster.avif?t=1765871925\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/28ee269ee2cb3dc50dfbba4b86f140c7.webm?t=1765871925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/28ee269ee2cb3dc50dfbba4b86f140c7.mp4?t=1765871925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf9 While you work, Tidy Bot will clean your tiny room on your desktop. Whilst Tidy Bot cleans, you will earn <strong>Tidy Tokens</strong> that can be used to <strong>customize</strong> your <strong>room</strong>, Tidy Bot's <strong>head</strong> and <strong>color</strong>, and also to <strong>upgrade</strong> Tidy Bot to improve cleaning speed, tokens earned, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/3003c22c5fce5bad0514078691db6e55.poster.avif?t=1765871925\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/3003c22c5fce5bad0514078691db6e55.webm?t=1765871925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/3003c22c5fce5bad0514078691db6e55.mp4?t=1765871925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Unlock new rooms, heads, and colors for Tidy Bot. With over <strong>10 rooms</strong>, <strong>40 heads</strong>, and <strong>many colors</strong> to choose from, you can create your very own unique little room. Can you get every head?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/10181611dab69879bc739908bacdf32f.poster.avif?t=1765871925\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/10181611dab69879bc739908bacdf32f.webm?t=1765871925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/10181611dab69879bc739908bacdf32f.mp4?t=1765871925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Wonder what your <strong>Tidy</strong> <strong>Tokens</strong> can be used for? To open mystery boxes, of course! Enjoy a fun reveal animation as your <strong>room</strong>, <strong>head,</strong> or <strong>color</strong> rolls in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/8d7bc3792713c6345f5337ca06f9a585.poster.avif?t=1765871925\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/8d7bc3792713c6345f5337ca06f9a585.webm?t=1765871925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/8d7bc3792713c6345f5337ca06f9a585.mp4?t=1765871925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Once your room is finished cleaning, Tidy Bot will proceed to power down and play a fun little reset animation. On which, Tidy Bot will start the cycle of cleaning the room and earning you more Tidy Tokens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/0d068d13d6d510a5393b5fb380d074d1.poster.avif?t=1765871925\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/0d068d13d6d510a5393b5fb380d074d1.webm?t=1765871925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/0d068d13d6d510a5393b5fb380d074d1.mp4?t=1765871925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f And that's not all, you can also update Tidy Bots software! By doing so, you can upgrade different stats that are permanent each update. Also, with every software update Tidy Bot goes through, you can earn Tidy Bux!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sold out!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839150/1fbc4181d0fb214b7343e05f9bceb9acb3811039.jpg"},{"name":"World's Best Boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839150/498175e138b1508ee8fe0462594a55e161981a7e.jpg"},{"name":"In Space no one can see you clean...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839150/66ffd7481c7198d2a33afe626275782249dcaf4f.jpg"},{"name":"Dungeons No Dragons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839150/f3d4cdfb9e8e008c708ba9ec81a72c407b1faf2b.jpg"},{"name":"Death by 1000 Cleans","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839150/dd197d7ea57d279d5739469e073eb1ed4f101cf2.jpg"},{"name":"Bibbidi Bobbidi Boom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839150/5354e11121e483dad5be2bea06a8b3ffa2150053.jpg"},{"name":"Get To Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839150/bb22124632450958b73188970dfa434561b32b0e.jpg"},{"name":"The Good, the Bad and the Tidy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839150/1c44bba9a592ac8cb6cba6db4fe568598ca38b33.jpg"},{"name":"Big Spender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839150/7b52f4fbfff546dc5faef48255e49789327a9f9b.jpg"},{"name":"Ah Scrap, here we go again...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839150/1897b0ad59b5bc88d2f52dfa119a7661871d5722.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839150?t=1765871925","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/099eccbba67c8148def9b3576004121b9992203c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765871925","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/ac04485289088287457bb40d51116b84b80d5dbe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765871925","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/ac04485289088287457bb40d51116b84b80d5dbe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765871925","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cosy desktop idle game you can place anywhere on your screen! Oversee a tiny robot that keeps your room spotless while you work, focus, or unwind. Unlock various upgrades and hats for each iteration of your tidy robot. Transform your space as you unlock countless decorations to uniquely personalise your room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/28ee269ee2cb3dc50dfbba4b86f140c7.poster.avif?t=1765871925\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/28ee269ee2cb3dc50dfbba4b86f140c7.webm?t=1765871925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/28ee269ee2cb3dc50dfbba4b86f140c7.mp4?t=1765871925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf9 While you work, Tidy Bot will clean your tiny room on your desktop. Whilst Tidy Bot cleans, you will earn <strong>Tidy Tokens</strong> that can be used to <strong>customize</strong> your <strong>room</strong>, Tidy Bot's <strong>head</strong> and <strong>color</strong>, and also to <strong>upgrade</strong> Tidy Bot to improve cleaning speed, tokens earned, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/3003c22c5fce5bad0514078691db6e55.poster.avif?t=1765871925\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/3003c22c5fce5bad0514078691db6e55.webm?t=1765871925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839150/extras/3003c22c5fce5bad0514078691db6e55.mp4?t=176587192